@startuml View Banners Sequence Diagram
title UC-BN01 - View List Banners

actor "Admin" as User
participant "Banner\nGovernance Page" as Frontend
participant ":bannerRoutes" as Routes
participant ":bannerController" as Controller
participant ":bannerService" as Service
participant "Banner\nModel" as Model
database "MongoDB" as DB

User -> Frontend: 1. Open Banner Governance page
Frontend -> Routes: 2. GET /api/banners?page=1&limit=10&search=...\n(Bearer Token)

ref over Routes
Verify JWT Token and Admin Role
end ref
Routes -> Routes: 3. Check authentication/authorization result
opt [Authentication or authorization failed]
  Routes --> Frontend: 4. JSON error response (401/403)
  Frontend --> User: 5. Show error or redirect to login
end

Routes -> Controller: 6. getAllBanners(req, res)
Controller -> Service: 7. getAllBanners(query)

Service -> Model: 8. find(filter).sort().skip().limit().populate()
Model -> DB: 9. Query banners by filters
DB --> Model: 10. Banner list

Service -> Model: 11. countDocuments(filter)
Model -> DB: 12. Count total records
DB --> Model: 13. Total count

Model --> Service: 14. { data, total }
Service --> Controller: 15. { data, pagination }
Controller -> Controller: 16. formatPaginatedResponse(result, message)
Controller --> Routes: 17. HTTP 200
Routes --> Frontend: 18. JSON response\n{ success, data, pagination }

Frontend -> Frontend: 19. Render table and pagination
Frontend --> User: 20. Display banner list

@enduml
